  "details": "Currently Drones will collide with colliders on the Walkthrough layer. This makes sense as the drones themselves are not on the PlayerLocal layer, but is annoying because your drone will often smack into invisible walls that you would otherwise never see because you yourself would walk right through them. \n\nNot sure if this technically counts as a bug or a general annoyance, but it can make flying drones near impossible in worlds that are set up in unusual ways.",
